## Model card

- **Name:** Kimi K2.8 Preview
- **Short description:** Entry curated in `meta.json` as a verified absence: Moonshot’s model list, pricing, changelog, docs index, Hugging Face org, models.dev and OpenRouter all lack a standalone K2.8 checkpoint as of 2026-10-20. `meta.json` short: “No such Moonshot model could be verified as of 2026-10-20 — Moonshot’s model list, pricing, changelog, docs index, HF org, models.dev, OpenRouter and Zen all lack a K2.8; negative record, self-excluded report.” models.dev lists `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview` as a coding model with up to 1M context available through Kimi Code, mapping to provider ID `kimi-for-coding` with 1,048,576 context and $0.00/$0.00 pricing; Moonshot’s official docs page `platform.kimi.ai/docs/models` enumerates `kimi-k3`, `kimi-k2.7-code`, `kimi-k2.7-code-highspeed`, `kimi-k2.6` only — no K2.8 entry.
- **Provider / access:** Moonshot AI via Kimi Code membership surface; models.dev providers “Kimi For Coding (kimi.ai)” / “Kimi For Coding (kimi.com)” with model ID `kimi-for-coding`. No dedicated `kimi-k2.8-preview` API ID on Moonshot’s official model list; no OpenCode Zen Free ID per `meta.json` `noFreeId: true`.
- **Release / knowledge:** models.dev release 2026-09-11; knowledge cutoff not published. Moonshot official docs do not confirm a K2.8 release.
- **IDs:** `moonshot/kimi-k2-8-preview` per `meta.json` id; models.dev canonical `moonshotai/kimi-k2.8-preview` → provider `kimi-for-coding`. No verified vendor ID.
- **Context window:** `meta.json` `contextWindow`: “Unverified - no published figure (1M was claimed but never confirmed)”. models.dev reports 1,048,576 tokens input; 32,768 output limit listed. Vendor verification absent.
- **Modalities:** `meta.json` `modalities`: “Unverified - no published figure”. models.dev capabilities `tools, reasoning`. No official vendor modality table for a standalone K2.8 checkpoint.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-20):** `meta.json` `pricingNote`: “No published price - Moonshot’s API is pay-as-you-go per token; no K2.8 line exists on any price sheet”. models.dev shows $0.00/$0.00 for `kimi-for-coding` via Kimi Code membership. Paid membership-gated; no free tier.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary. Parameter count, MoE topology, and weights not published for a verified K2.8 checkpoint. `meta.json` `standout`: “A verified absence: the slot between K2.7 Code and K3 that never shipped, kept so the gap is auditable.”

